{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法依水土保持法（以下簡稱本法）第十九條第三項規定訂定之。","id":"M0110026/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"41ba17c0162d05f76fccb22194ca04f6e4746902aaa7ce2a19daef92c6ef6fe7","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"M0110026/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":30,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"本法第十九條第三項所稱一定規模以上之地貌改變，指其開發行為逾水土保持計畫審核監督辦法第三條所定種類及規模，或第四條第一項所定情形。\n前項開發行為須非位於山崩與地滑地質敏感區或土石流潛勢溪流及其影響範圍。","id":"M0110026/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"406baa1f91ac83b68aae4d23db2e69bac8666ec644e6fe8f1bffd3a4124489b4","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"M0110026/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":66,"children":[]},{"id":"M0110026/a:2/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":66,"end":101,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法自發布日施行。","id":"M0110026/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"47b8a3e12a88555780e2c610257366d820f6c2f5ed79aaf37d74ac3e56199b62","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"M0110026/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[],"category":"農業與山坡地","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國一百零八年五月八日行政院農業委員會農水保字第 108186461\n  1 號令、經濟部經水字第 10802604770  號令會銜訂定發布全文 3  條\n  ；並自發布日施行\n2.中華民國一百十三年七月九日農業部農農保字第 1132665030 號令、經\n  濟部經水字第 11360200120  號令、原住民族委員會原民土字第 11300\n  24356 號令會銜修正發布第 2  條條文","id":"M0110026","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2024-07-09","name":"特定水土保持區一定規模以上之地貌改變認定辦法","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=M0110026","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"ab1f639a0d2f0c76d0c30dc52b4ff0b6e4ea4cd72b729b5de94db105dde7afe3","sourceRecordId":